  "rampwidth": {
   "title": "RAMPS TOO NARROW",
   "sub": "FRONT EXTENSION WIDENING",
   "track": "Symphony one",
   "text": "Vehicles sitting too tight on the front extension ramps? That's a fitment problem, and it's fixable. We welded additional steel plates to the outer edges of the ramps, widening them to seventeen and three sixteenths inches. So why does width matter? Because a car that sits too tight is a car you can't load safely. The new extensions were ground smooth and finished in protective black paint. More width, proper fitment, safe loading. Need ramps that fit your cars? Call the shop.",
